---

<BaseLayout
  title="Career Counselling and Guidance by Location | Future Career School"
  description="City-intent career counselling and guidance pages for students, freshers, and working professionals who want location-aware clarity, delivered online across India."
  canonical="https://futurecareerschool.com/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/locations/"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <Nav activePage="career-guidance" />

  <section id="hero">
    <div class="hero-bg">
      <div class="orb orb-gold"></div>
      <div class="orb orb-teal"></div>
      <div class="grid"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services">Services</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance">Career Counselling and Guidance</a>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rsaquo;</span>
        <span aria-current="page">Locations</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="pill hero-pill">
        <span class="pill-dot"></span>
        Location-intent guidance within the main career support branch
      </div>

      <h1 class="hero-title">
        Career Counselling and Guidance
        <span class="gold-text"> by Location</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Some people search by city because they want support that feels closer, more reachable, and easier to trust.
        The better filter is not only locality. It is whether the guidance improves decision quality, skill direction, proof of work, and long-term growth.
      </p>
      <p class="hero-sub hero-sub-secondary">
        Guidance is delivered online across India, so people can start from home, college, or work instead of depending on one nearby office. Location pages should help people compare fit and context without trapping them inside weak local-only assumptions.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-gold pulse">Get Student Career Guidance</a>
        <a href="#plans" class="btn-outline">Get Working Professional Career Guidance</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <LinkDirectorySection
    sectionId="city-pages"
    title="City-Specific Career Guidance Pages"
    subtitle="Open the city page that matches your search intent, then compare the next step based on clarity, practical value, and decision quality."
    items={completeLocationItems}
  />

  <ContextualCta
    audience="mixed"
    title="Use the city page when locality helps you start, but move based on the strongest next step"
    body="The practical goal is clearer decisions, stronger skill direction, and better follow-through, not a weak local-only filter."
    studentHref="#plans"
    studentLabel="Get Student Career Guidance"
    professionalHref="#plans"
    professionalLabel="Get Working Professional Career Guidance"
  />

  <LinkDirectorySection
    sectionId="city-support-pages"
    title="Broader Guidance Pages"
    subtitle="If the city matters less than the decision itself, these main guidance pages are the stronger next filter."
    items={supportItems}
    altBackground={true}
  />

  <GuidancePlansSection
    audience="mixed"
    serviceLabel="Career Guidance"
  />

  <ContextualCta
    audience="mixed"
    title="If the city matters less than the full career decision, use the main guidance path before waiting longer"
    body="A broader page is the better next move when the real problem is path fit, skill direction, or growth pressure rather than locality itself."
    studentHref="#plans"
    studentLabel="Get Student Career Guidance"
    professionalHref="#plans"
    professionalLabel="Get Working Professional Career Guidance"
  />

  <section id="cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-inner card">
        <div class="cta-glow"></div>
        <div class="cta-content">
          <div class="pill cta-pill">Next step</div>
          <h2 class="cta-title">Choose the stronger next move</h2>
          <p class="cta-sub">
            Start with the city page if local search intent matters. If the bigger issue is the career decision itself, move straight into the main guidance path.
          </p>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a href={BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.visakhapatnamCounselling} class="btn-gold pulse">Get Visakhapatnam Guidance</a>
            <a href={BOFU_INTERNAL_LINKS.parentGuidance} class="btn-outline">Get Broader Career Guidance</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  section { position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  #hero { padding: 140px 0 86px; }
  .hero-bg { position: absolute; inset: 0; }
  .orb { position: absolute; border-radius: 50%; filter: blur(120px); pointer-events: none; }
  .orb-gold { width: 520px; height: 520px; top: -170px; left: -110px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(229,184,74,.18), transparent 70%); }
  .orb-teal { width: 420px; height: 420px; top: -40px; right: -120px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(45,212,191,.11), transparent 70%); }
  .grid {
    position: absolute; inset: 0;
    background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,.06) 1px, transparent 1px), linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,.06) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 80px 80px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 10%, rgba(0,0,0,.8), transparent 60%);
    opacity: .16;
  }
  .hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .breadcrumb { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.38); margin-bottom: 2rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .breadcrumb a { color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); transition: color .2s; }
  .breadcrumb a:hover { color: rgba(255,255,255,.85); }
  .hero-pill { width: fit-content; margin-bottom: 1.6rem; }
  .pill-dot { width: 7px; height: 7px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--teal); flex-shrink: 0; }
  .hero-title { font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 5vw, 3.9rem); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -.04em; color: #fff; max-width: 980px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .hero-sub { font-size: clamp(15px, 1.9vw, 18px); color: rgba(255,255,255,.56); line-height: 1.8; max-width: 780px; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .hero-sub-secondary { color: rgba(255,255,255,.64); margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  #cta { padding: 6rem 0 7rem; }
  .cta-inner { position: relative; overflow: hidden; padding: 3.25rem; text-align: center; border-color: rgba(229,184,74,.14); background: rgba(229,184,74,.02); }
  .cta-glow { position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(229,184,74,.16), transparent 60%); pointer-events: none; }
  .cta-content { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .cta-pill { margin: 0 auto 1.4rem; width: fit-content; color: rgba(255,255,255,.55); }
  .cta-title { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.6rem); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -.03em; color: #fff; margin-bottom: .9rem; }
  .cta-sub { font-size: 15px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.5); line-height: 1.75; max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto 2.25rem; }
  .cta-actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    #hero { padding: 120px 0 72px; }
    .hero-actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
    .hero-actions .btn-gold, .hero-actions .btn-outline, .hero-actions .btn-soft { justify-content: center; }
    .cta-inner { padding: 2.25rem 1.5rem; }
    .cta-actions { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
    .cta-actions .btn-gold, .cta-actions .btn-outline { justify-content: center; }
  }
</style>
